  "modelingNotes": [
    "OSM locates the 17 m long chapel, 20 m corner tower, low 4.5 m range and 15 m rear range. Tagged 4 m roof rises remain unchanged.",
    "The unheighted entrance range follows the adjoining 17 m gabled body with 4 m rise. Untagged roof rises use 1 m at the tower and 3 m at the 15 m rear range; the small uncovered plan uses 4.5 m. These are explicit visual inferences from the inspected Couvent des Franciscains street view.",
    "Tall paired lancets, a narrow corner tower and horizontal bands retain the neo-Gothic massing. The brick wall material retains the chapel’s distinctive contrast within the approved Clair palette; tracery and individual dormer ornament are omitted."
  ],
